"""Aquarium v0's scene (etapp 1, steg 2): the design the page is rendered into, held by the chain driver.

SCEN is the static Swedish page: the diorama with its five places (Arkivet, Verkstaden, Utkiken, Ägarens bord, Sockeln), the
water's light, the three looks (fresh, quiet, stale) and the deepening panels. Every shown value is a {{AQ_...}}
placeholder or an <!--AQ:LISTA:...--> list slot that the renderer fills with escaped text from a display-safe projection
(tools/aquarium.py). The page starts in the stale look (class aq-inaktuell); only SKRIPT, placed once at <!--AQ:SKRIPT-->
and pinned by its SHA-256 in the page's Content-Security-Policy, compares the reading's time with the viewer's clock and
switches to the fresh look while the reading is younger than the given limit. Nothing here reads, runs or changes
anything. The renderer that fills SCEN is a separate step (etapp 1, steg 4) and keeps both constants unchanged.
"""

